<title>UK: UK M4 grows final 9.0 pct in year to July.</title>
<headline>UK M4 grows final 9.0 pct in year to July.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England published the following data on UK monetary aggregates for July -</p>
<p>    MONEY SUPPLY				     July   Pvs Reported</p>
<p>    M4 in month	  (adjusted)		+0.5	 +0.4</p>
<p>	 in year to date (adjusted)		+9.0	 +8.8</p>
<p>    M4 in month	  (unadjusted)	    unch	 -0.1</p>
<p>	 in year to date (unadjusted)	    +8.9	 +8.7</p>
<p>	  -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
